      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Decode a saved latent to video (crash recovery)\n\nThe loop workflows save the assembled latent (SaveLatent, `latents/segment_*.latent` under the run's output folder) BEFORE the final decode. If a render dies at the decode, nothing is lost:\n\n1. Copy the `.latent` file into ComfyUI's INPUT directory.\n2. Pick it in LoadLatent; load the same song in LoadAudio.\n3. Run on a FRESH server (no diffusion model resident -> the decode fits easily).\n\nTrims mirror the canonical chain (latent trim -> decode -> image trim) so A/V sync matches a normal render. fps widgets assume 25."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
